      "description": "Alta is your personal AI stylist elevates your style and generates personalized outfits based on your closet, lifestyle, budget, and weather, for any day or special event. Most people wear less than 20% of their closets regularly, and everyday clothing decisions impact your mood and how you present yourself in all aspects of life. \n\nAlta’s mission is to help everyone look and feel their best, and is advised by celebrity stylists and global editors from Vogue.\n\n[Personalized AI Outfit Recommendations]\n- Get daily outfit suggestions based on the weather and your schedule.\n- Generate outfits for any event, from “date night in Paris” to “work conference in Vegas”\n- Want to wear that specific jacket? Ask Alta to generate outfits with it.\n\n[Organize Your Digital Closet]\n- Add to your closet by 1) forwarding email receipts 2) adding from the Alta database 3) taking a photo and having Alta find the original photo (if possible to be found)\n- Advanced AI technology removes photo backgrounds and automatically adds clothing details (fabric, fit, etc) to make adding items quick and easy.\n- Data on your style, your most/least worn pieces, and your cost-per-wear\n\n[Packing lists + travel lookbooks]\n- Tell Alta where you are traveling, the activities you have planned, and your luggage size, and Alta will generate a packing list and a travel lookbook for you.\n- Don’t worry if you are city-hopping, Alta can handle multiple cities and climates on a single trip.\n- Share your packing lists with friends and family via a shareable link you can text.\n\n[Shopping Recommendations Based on your Closet Gaps]\n- Alta will tell you what is missing from your closet, so you can shop intelligently.\n- Alta surfaces shopping recommendations from both your favorite brands and new ones we think you might like.\n- Eyeing a new piece? Add it to your Alta wishlist, and Alta will notify you when it goes on sale.\n- Alta will show you how to wear a new piece by generating outfits with it.\n\n[Virtual Try-On]\n- Generate the outfit on an avatar that looks like you. You can see how the outfit looks without even having to put it on.\n\n[Alta Web app]\n- Want to use Alta on your laptop? Just go to altadaily.com! \n\nThe more you interact with Alta, the more Alta learns your style. Your Alta is personalized to you.\n\nFind us at instagram.com/alta",
